@base = http://localhost:3001

### List contacts
GET {{base}}/api/persons

### Database info
GET {{base}}/info

### Create a contact
POST {{base}}/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "number": "040-1234567"
}

### Use an id returned by the POST request
GET {{base}}/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID

### Update contact
PUT {{base}}/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "number": "040-7654321"
}

### Delete contact
DELETE {{base}}/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
